      "Language": "eng",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "A 45-year-old woman was admitted to hospital following acute onset of lower back pain. Clinical and laboratory investigations established a lumbar paraspinal soft tissue infection with Mycoplasma hominis associated with severe spondylarthrosis at L5/S1. A relationship to a recently performed hysterectomy must be considered."},
